<title>SPAIN: Spain Nov currency reserves rose $2.324 billion.</title>
<headline>Spain Nov currency reserves rose $2.324 billion.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain gave the following provisional figures (millions of dollars):</p>
<p> RESERVES		     NOV 96     OCT 96     NOV 95</p>
<p> Rise/fall in month	2,324.3    1,462.4	167.4</p>
<p> End-month total	  60,186.6   57,862.3   37,868.4</p>
</text>
